    "Wear the recorder all day. When it goes back in its case, OpenBean syncs, transcribes, splits the day into conversations and writes the day's diary and to-dos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整天戴着录音豆。放回盒子后，OpenBean 会同步、转写、把一天切成一段段对话，并写好当天的日记和待办。"
          }
